(:include "bot_base.domain")

// Cleaner bot: walk to the best puddle and clean it, else idle. The smallest variant: one sensor fact, one job step,
// one constant override.
//
// Teaches: a variant that overrides only the target pick, the job and a constant (`approach_range`: SS14 walks the
// cleaner to melee range, 1 m, not the interaction range).
// Source: Space Station 14 (MIT), `CleanbotCompound`, `BufferNearbyPuddlesCompound` in
// Resources/Prototypes/NPCs/cleanbot.yml and the `NearbyPuddles` utility query, at commit
// 614f030530578e248a2393dd71ee9813d68d800d:
// https://github.com/space-wizards/space-station-14/blob/614f030530578e248a2393dd71ee9813d68d800d/Resources/Prototypes/NPCs/cleanbot.yml
// Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2017-2026 Space Wizards Federation; see src/examples/canon/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
// Adapted (YAML prototypes re-written in our domain language).
// Emulations: the utility query (puddles, by distance, accessible, in line of sight; `PuddleFilter`) is the host
// sensor `(puddle ?entity)`, best first.
// Deviations: SS14's interaction has a "target in range" precondition and a `PuddleService` re-picking the puddle
// while it works; here get-in-range is the reach tier and the re-pick is the sensor plus a replan.
// Not ported: nothing else in cleanbot.yml.
//
// Facts:      (puddle ?entity) host sensor, best first; (distance_to ?entity ?metres); idle's.
// Primitives: (!move_near ?entity ?range) (!clean ?entity), idle's.

(:domain CleanerBot top_level_domain

    (:constants CleanerBotConstants overrides ServiceBot
        (approach_range 1.0)
    )

    (:axiom (job_target ?out_target) overrides ServiceBot
        (and
            (puddle ?out_target)
        )
    )

    (:method (do_job ?inp_target) overrides ServiceBot

        (clean
            ()
            (
                (!clean ?inp_target)
            )
        )
    )

    (:method (behave) top_level_method

        (bot
            ()
            (
                (run_bot)
            )
        )
    )
)
